  "details": "For ultra nerds, maybe all of the unity graphics settings could be exposed? I'm thinking an advanced mode for advanced users. Like what we have now is low, medium, high ultra ETC, but it would be cool to have a \"custom\" preset where we can mess with the individual settings to really fine-tune performance to our liking. What I mean by this is being able to change stuff individually, instead of just having a preset. Kind of like the unity graphics settings in the editor.",
